# 10. Conclusion

This paper introduced K‑Net—a comprehensive framework for organizing knowledge based on ternary logic and a geodesic knowledge sphere. Its four main components (ternary logic, Knowledge Sphere, immune system, and Why Engine) work together to create a system that can manage uncertainty, reduce conflicts, and perform causal reasoning. The current MVP implements all four components as a Proof of Concept. Preliminary simulation results show that the Knowledge Sphere can reduce conflict energy by 74% and lower memory usage by 88% compared to a Float32 adjacency matrix.

